 "description": "Goldbeter1995_CircClock\nBioModels BIOMD0000000016 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000016_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 300 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000016_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: oscillating), sampling 0.3.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 4.62e-06 of species peak (worst: P1)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] species 'Pt' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] rP01: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] rP10: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] rP12: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] rP21: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] rmRNAd: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] rVd: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): M1 = M",
